Package: atomrust
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Carson Fenimore <fenimore@gmail.com>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: @SHLIBS@, adduser, overlayroot, initramfs-tools
Recommends: iw
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/carsonfenimore/atomrust
Description: low-overhead RTSP camera server for Raspberry Pi
 Streams the Pi camera's hardware-encoded H.264 over RTSP without decoding,
 optionally runs TFLite object detection on a low-res stream and reports
 detections and system stats to Home Assistant via MQTT.
 .
 Includes atomrust-ro / atomrust-rw to run the Pi with a read-only SD card
 (RAM overlay root) and switch back for updates.
